      <room>H.1309</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>Smolt and Web Application Privacy</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>CentOS + Fedora</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This presentation will go over some of what &lt;a href=&#34;https://hosted.fedoraproject.org/smolt/wiki&#34;&gt;Smolt&lt;/a&gt; can do for you and your Linux distribution.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It will also cover some of the privacy issues related to Smolt, how they are solved using standard security features, and how they can be used in other web applications.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="1281">Yaakov Nemoy</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>